88eb1eda10a47500ef3e8e29777bb210fd3703d12654f01b0a7fbbe5d2086209f8cb4051a93fae3d098189ec84f8e53dfbd6561b179113bf88c32911d41eb9c0  0001-build-without-appstream-on-qnx.patch
"
